 photo: Large black-framed insulated patio cover with ceiling fans over cream wicker sofas surrounded by palms\"><img src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/insulated-patio-cover-black-frame-ceiling-fans-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Large black-framed insulated patio cover with ceiling fans over cream wicker sofas surrounded by palms\" width=\"1024\" height=\"667\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-white-large-span-travertine-patio-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Large white louvered roof with partly open blades over a travertine patio with wicker lounge furniture\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-white-large-span-travertine-patio-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Large white louvered roof with partly open blades over a travertine patio with wicker lounge furniture\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-white-open-blades-travertine-patio-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: White louvered roof with blades open against a blue sky over a travertine patio with wicker furniture\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-white-open-blades-travertine-patio-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"White louvered roof with blades open against a blue sky over a travertine patio with wicker furniture\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/pergolas/covered-pergola-brown-paver-patio-pool-palms-florida-02.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Brown covered pergola with rafter tails over a paver patio with turquoise seating, grill and freeform pool\"><img src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/covered-pergola-brown-paver-patio-pool-palms-florida-02.webp\" alt=\"Brown covered pergola with rafter tails over a paver patio with turquoise seating, grill and freeform pool\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"mm-gal-mas\">[{\"url\":\"/images/banco/pergolas/wood-pergola-outdoor-kitchen-putting-green-lake-florida-01.webp\",\"alt\":\"Dark wood pergola over an outdoor kitchen bar and lounge with TV screen beside a putting green.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/banco/pergolas/freestanding-patio-cover-bronze-pool-deck-travertine-florida-01.webp\",\"alt\":\"Freestanding bronze insulated pergola with slatted privacy screen and wicker seating beside a curved pool\"}]</script></section><div><section class=\"mm-que mm-que--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Outdoor Furniture Design, Installation &amp; Renovation</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We curate and install premium outdoor furniture in teak, aluminum, and wicker for North and South Florida homes and estates.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Custom Layouts, Modular Seating</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We size dining sets, sectionals, and chaises to the lanai, pool deck, or terrace they will sit on, so walkways, door swings, and screen enclosure posts stay clear. Modular sections rearrange for a family dinner or a twenty-person party, so one set covers both.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Patio Furniture Design</dt><dd>South Florida designers create custom outdoor furniture plans tailored to homeowners’ style and space</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Modular Seating Design &amp; Installation</dt><dd>Installers create modular seating arrangements to maximize patio space and flexibility</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Teak, Hardwood &amp; Aluminum</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Teak and dense tropical hardwoods hold up to Florida humidity and weather down to a gray patina you can leave alone or re-oil. Powder-coated aluminum stays light enough to carry indoors and resists salt-air corrosion. We use stainless hardware on both, since plated fasteners corrode first.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Teak &amp; Hardwood Furniture Installation</dt><dd>Installers assemble and install durable teak and hardwood furniture sets for residential patios.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Aluminum Furniture Assembly Services</dt><dd>Contractors install lightweight, rust‑resistant aluminum furniture for long‑lasting outdoor use.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Wicker Lounges, Sustainable Sourcing</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">All-weather resin wicker woven over aluminum frames keeps its color under Florida UV instead of turning brittle like natural rattan. We cover cushions in solution-dyed acrylic that sheds an afternoon downpour and resists mildew, and we source FSC-certified teak and recycled-content frames on request.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Wicker Lounge Set Installation</dt><dd>Builders set up weather‑proof wicker lounges and seating areas that blend comfort and style</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Sustainable Outdoor Furniture Solutions</dt><dd>Designers recommend eco‑friendly materials and accessories for environmentally conscious homeowners</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Refinishing, Delivery &amp; Placement</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Good frames outlast their finish, so we sand and re-oil teak, re-strap aluminum, and rebuild cushions rather than replace a set that still fits. Our crews deliver, assemble, and place each piece, keep egress paths clear, and leave lightweight items easy to stow when a storm watch goes up.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Outdoor Furniture Renovation Services</dt><dd>Contractors refurbish existing furniture with durable finishes and cushions for continued use.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Professional Furniture Installation &amp; Staging</dt><dd>South Florida installers professionally place and secure outdoor furniture for a polished look.</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc mm-proc--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Outdoor Furniture <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our team guides Florida homeowners in selecting and installing premium outdoor furniture for lasting comfort and beauty on patios and pool areas.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><ol class=\"mm-pasos\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Planning &amp; Selection</h3><p>Contract execution, project documentation, and selection of outdoor furniture to match the design and client preferences.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Order Placement</h3><p>Furniture is ordered and confirmed with supplier, including lead times and specifications.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Delivery Scheduling</h3><p>Coordinate and schedule delivery to align with project completion and site readiness. Furniture is delivered, placed, and arranged in the designated areas.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Final Touches &amp; Enjoyment</h3><p>Final adjustments completed and space is ready for use and enjoyment.</p></li></ol></div></section>";
const T6 = "<section class=\"mm-faq\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Outdoor Furniture <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about premium outdoor furniture in Florida? Our team helps North and South Florida homeowners select and install durable pieces.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>What outdoor materials last longest in Florida climates?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Teak, powder-coated aluminum, and high-density polyethylene wicker all resist humidity, salt air, and UV exposure — making them ideal for Florida's coastal and inland climates. These materials maintain structural integrity and appearance without the warping, rust, or fading common with lower-grade outdoor materials.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How do I care for teak outdoor furniture in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Teak outdoor furniture requires minimal care in Florida climates, as its natural oils protect against rot, pest damage, and warping even in direct sun and coastal humidity. Occasional cleaning and optional oiling every one to two years maintains the wood's rich appearance and extends the life of your investment significantly.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Is HDPE wicker furniture durable in Florida's climate?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. High-density polyethylene wicker is engineered to resist UV fading, moisture absorption, cracking, and mold growth — making it one of the most durable outdoor furniture materials for Florida's humid, sun-intense climate. HDPE wicker maintains its color and structural integrity for many years with only occasional cleaning required.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do outdoor cushions resist Florida sun and humidity?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Premium outdoor cushions use solution-dyed acrylic fabrics engineered for UV fading, mildew, and moisture resistance. These quick-dry materials are designed for Florida's intense sun and frequent rain. Properly maintained cushions retain their color and shape across multiple years of year-round outdoor use in South Florida.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can you help design the layout of my outdoor space?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Our design team provides personalized layout guidance to arrange outdoor furniture for optimal traffic flow and visual proportion on your Florida patio or pool deck. From selecting the right scale of pieces to coordinating finishes with your home's exterior, every installation reflects the aesthetic of a well-designed outdoor space.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-faq-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/wood-pergola-outdoor-kitchen-putting-green-lake-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Dark wood pergola over an outdoor kitchen bar and lounge with TV screen beside a putting green.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"mm-faq-accion\"><a class=\"mm-btn\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"testimonial-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"74852c7c-aeb3-35a7-5cf1-44f4ce6ecae5\" class=\"header-reviews\"><div class=\"label\">TESTIMONIALS</div><h2 class=\"white\">What Our Clients Say About Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living</h2><p>Read testimonials from Florida homeowners who value the comfort and lasting durability of premium outdoor furniture selected and installed by our team.</p></div>";
